OL,3,AFirst human case of Shamonda virus
OL,4,Adetected in France, officials say
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe European Centre for Disease
OL,7,FPrevention and Control (ECDC) said it
OL,8,Fwas monitoring the situation and
OL,9,Fofficials were still investigating how
OL,10,Fthe virus had spread to a human.
